{"unit_id":"ManoloRemiddi__dsh-model-picker-augmented#feature-curation","repo":"ManoloRemiddi/dsh-model-picker-augmented","commit":"3264aa74ce7267a2069de4d7d6808a6f6b7f00f4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Model Picker Augmented 的功能「隐藏与置顶」：设置页面允许逐个模型切换显示状态、置顶或取消置顶，并用上下移动作排列置顶模型；更改会写入插件设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:145-180","lib/client.js:560-710"]}
